# Grok + MegaLens — fix loop (code allowed)

**This chat codes and ships.** No auditor/builder split. No handover-only.

## Grok (free — use often)

Run `grok_search` on user-grok MCP **before** edits that touch:

- ImGui lifecycle (`on_frame` vs `on_draw_ui`, `begin_window`, child stack)
- Map pins / `addMapIconInfoList` / `setupMapIcon`
- Overlay visibility / `IsLoadGui` / pause menu
- New hooks or SDK invoke ladders

**Query shape:** Senior Lua REFramework DD2 — symptom, file:line, before/after, ask SOUND/SPAGHETTI.

Reply must include: `GROK QUERY:` / `GROK VERDICT:` / `GROK SOURCES:` (when searched).

**See `grok-inner-voice-mandatory.mdc` — minimum 3 `grok_search` calls before ANY ship. No "obvious fix" bypass.**

## MegaLens L3 (~$0.22 — use when stuck)

**Run when any of:**

- Same bug class returns after a “fix” (labels, overlay, colors, cache flush)
- Touching **2+** of: window draw, map, overlay, cache, SDK in one ship
- User says “megalens” / “audit everything” / “spaghetti”
- Static + logs + Grok still disagree on root cause

**Gates before charge:**

- Game log first line = workspace `MOD_VERSION`
- Concrete P0/P1 questions (max 5–8), not “audit all”
- User ok with ~$0.22 OR explicitly asked for MegaLens

**`fileContext` = full file text, never paths.** One bundle per run:

| Run | Files |
|-----|--------|
| **Wiring** | `quest_tracker.lua` + `quest_tracker_plugins.lua` + `quest_tracker/quest_tracker_overlay.lua` |
| **UI draw** | `quest_tracker_window.lua` + `quest_tracker_window_child.lua` |
| **Map** | `quest_tracker_map.lua` (or label section if too big — split file first) |
| **Data/steps** | `quest_tracker_cache.lua` + `quest_tracker_steps_resolve.lua` + `quest_data_loader.lua` |

Poll `megalens_poll` until `terminal: true`. If `MCP_NEEDS_PLANNER_REPAIR` → smaller bundle or split map module first; **do not retry same payload.**

Fix **P0/P1 from judge only**; bump version; `_ship_check.ps1`; Fluffy zip.

## Anti-spaghetti (pair with `no-spaghetti-decomposition.mdc`)

| File | ~lines | Next split |
|------|--------|------------|
| `quest_tracker_map.lua` | 2000+ | `quest_tracker_map_labels.lua`, `quest_tracker_map_pins.lua` |
| `quest_tracker_window.lua` | 1200+ | `quest_tracker_window_draw.lua`, frame loop stays thin |
| `quest_tracker_gather.lua` | 1400+ | NPC scan vs rebuild |
| `quest_data_loader.lua` | 980+ | tiers/wiki vs core data |

**Forbidden:** symptom hacks in draw path; duplicate ImGui begin/end; fake-success API checks (`result ~= nil` without list count); moving `begin_window` to `on_draw_ui`.

**Required ship gates** (already in `_ship_check.ps1`): no `begin_window` in `on_draw_ui`; no `call6_false`; map list count guard.

## Default order every bug fix

1. Read game logs (see `read-game-logs-first.mdc`)
2. Grok if risky area
3. Minimal fix + regression gate in `_ship_check.ps1` if new failure mode
4. `_ship_check.ps1` → zip → user Fluffy install → read log again
5. MegaLens L3 only if step 4 FAIL or repeat regression
